---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
const feeds = [
  { title: '全部文章', label: 'All writing · 中文与英文', path: '/rss.xml' },
  { title: '中文', label: 'Chinese-language articles', path: '/rss/zh.xml' },
  { title: 'English', label: 'English-language articles', path: '/rss/en.xml' },
];
---
<Layout title="RSS 订阅 / Subscribe | Jia-Hao Ji" description="通过RSS订阅纪家灏的文章，支持全部、中文和英文三个订阅源。Follow Jay’s research notes and essays in your own RSS reader." lang="zh-CN">
  <header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">RSS / Open publishing</p><h1>在你的阅读器里，<br />继续阅读。</h1><p>选择一个订阅源，把地址添加到你的 RSS 阅读器。无需注册，无需留下邮箱。<br /><span lang="en">Follow new writing in your own reader, without creating another account.</span></p></header>
  <div class="feed-options">{feeds.map(feed => <section class="feed-option"><h2>{feed.title}</h2><p>{feed.label}</p><code>{SITE.url}{feed.path}</code><a class="text-link" href={feed.path}>打开订阅源 / Open feed ↗</a></section>)}</div>
  <div class="subscribe-instructions"><h2>怎么使用</h2><p>复制上方地址，在阅读器中选择“添加订阅”，粘贴并确认。每次博客发布新文章，订阅源会随网站构建自动更新。</p><p>订阅源包含最近50篇文章的标题、摘要、作者、日期与原文链接。图文、公式和交互演示请打开原文阅读。中英双语版本各有独立地址；选择单一语言的订阅源可减少重复提醒。</p><h2 lang="en">How it works</h2><p lang="en">Copy a feed URL into the “Add subscription” field in your RSS reader. Each feed contains up to 50 recent articles with their title, summary, author, publication date and original link. Open the website for full articles and interactive demonstrations. Updates require no third-party publishing service.</p><p><a class="text-link" href="/blog/">返回文章列表 / Browse the archive →</a></p></div>
</Layout>
